{"type": "page", "page_no": 32, "printed_no": null, "chars": 69, "source": "text_layer", "has_pinyin": false, "fonts": ["AlibabaPuHuiTi_2_75_Semi", "FZCKJW--GB1-0", "FZKTK--GBK1-0", "FZLANTY_XIK--GBK1-0", "FZY3JW--GB1-0"], "text": "蜜蜂\n小提琴独奏\n聆听\n25\n1. 请随音乐模仿小提琴的演奏姿势，你能发现音乐旋律\n的高低变化吗？\n2. 说一说，乐曲是由哪件乐器伴奏的？"}
